# Every text file is stored and checked out with LF, on every platform.
# Prettier enforces LF, so without this a Windows clone with autocrlf drifts
# into CRLF working files and blobs that fail `prettier --check` locally while
# CI stays green. Attributes win over any contributor's core.autocrlf setting.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets - never subject to line-ending conversion.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
